<h1 data-copy-en="Glitch" data-copy-zh="Glitch">Glitch</h1>
<p class="starter-description" data-copy-en="Reach Glitch’s Den and follow her lessons, personal route, recruitment and private activities." data-copy-zh="找到Glitch的藏身处，推进技能课程、个人路线、军队招募与私人活动。">Reach Glitch’s Den and follow her lessons, personal route, recruitment and private activities.</p>
<div class="wiki-source-line"><span data-copy-en="v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026" data-copy-zh="v1.0_BETAx · 2026 年 11 月 9 日更新">v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026</span></div></div></section>
<section class="section wiki-reading-section"><div class="container wiki-reading-layout">
<aside class="wiki-toc"><div class="wiki-toc-inner"><button aria-expanded="false" class="wiki-toc-toggle" data-wiki-toc-toggle="" type="button"><span data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</span><span aria-hidden="true">+</span></button><p class="wiki-toc-heading" data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</p><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="en" data-wiki-toc-links=""><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-overview">Overview</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-location">Where to find them</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-route">Route and relationship milestones</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-activities">Activities and rewards</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-troubleshooting">What usually blocks the next step</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-related">Related guides</a></div><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="zh" data-wiki-toc-links="" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-overview">概览</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-location">去哪里找</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-route">路线与关系进展</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-activities">行动与奖励</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-troubleshooting">卡住时检查什么</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-related">相关指南</a></div></div></aside>
<article class="wiki-article"><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-en" data-lang-panel="en" lang="en"><section id="en-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Overview"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="First_Meeting_and_Early_Progress"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Personal_Heart-to-Hearts"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="The_Camera_She_Chose"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="When_the_Channel_Is_Quiet"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="No_Diagnostic_for_This"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Dates"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Kupie's_Love_Training"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Kupie.27s_Love_Training"></span><h2>Overview</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="View full screenshot: Glitch — character portrait." href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/glitch.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Glitch — character portrait." decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/glitch.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Glitch — character portrait.</figcaption></figure><p>Glitch is the hacker at Glitch’s Den. Her route includes seven personal encounters, three H2Hs, two dates, four skill lessons, army recruitment and later private activities and an optional family route. Her professional lessons and personal story are separate tracks.</p></section>
<section id="en-location"><h2>Where to find them</h2><p>After completing Story 21, use Visit Glitch’s Den at Unregistered Housing Complex in the Future Fringe Zone; the entrance takes no additional time. Her portrait is available all day, every day. Automatic personal encounters use this den; dates and H2Hs begin from her portrait.</p></section>
<section id="en-route"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Personal_Quest_Walkthrough"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Current_Route_Boundaries_and_Troubleshooting"></span><h2>Route and relationship milestones</h2><p>After Story 66, reach Acknowledged (10) and enter the den for Already Connected. Follow the automatic sequence and the three H2Hs below. The two dates are optional outings rather than required steps in the army or personal chain.</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Automatic scene</th><th scope="col">Location / start window</th><th scope="col">Requirements</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Already Connected</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Glitch's Den; all day</td><td data-label="Requirements">Acknowledged (10); after Story 66</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Red Team of One</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Glitch's Den; all day</td><td data-label="Requirements">Known (25); after Already Connected</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Classroom That Never Closed</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Glitch's Den; all day</td><td data-label="Requirements">Acquaintance (50); after Red Team of One</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Trace Runs Both Ways</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Glitch's Den; all day</td><td data-label="Requirements">Acquaintance (50); after The Classroom That Never Closed</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Permission to Disconnect</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Glitch's Den; all day</td><td data-label="Requirements">Friend (100); after The Trace Runs Both Ways / The Camera She Chose</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Person Behind the Alert</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Glitch's Den; all day</td><td data-label="Requirements">Close Friend (200); after Permission to Disconnect / When the Channel Is Quiet</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Mutual Authentication</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Glitch's Den; all day</td><td data-label="Requirements">Crush (400); after The Person Behind the Alert / No Diagnostic for This</td></tr></tbody></table><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Requirements / start window</th><th scope="col">Cost / recovery</th><th scope="col">Reward / limit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">The Camera She Chose</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Friend (100); after The Trace Runs Both Ways; 10:00–21:59</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">60 min; 15 Energy</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">When the Channel Is Quiet</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Close Friend (200); after Permission to Disconnect / The Camera She Chose; 18:00–22:59</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">60 min; 15 Energy; restores 10 Calm</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">No Diagnostic for This</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Crush (400); after The Person Behind the Alert / When the Channel Is Quiet; 20:00–22:59</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">60 min; 15 Energy</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">once</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Permission to Disconnect is the army recruitment milestone. The personal story continues afterwards through The Person Behind the Alert and Mutual Authentication. Private Time with Glitch is a separate continuation after Mutual Authentication at Romantic (800), not an alternative way to skip those scenes.</p></section>
<section id="en-activities"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Skill_Lessons"></span><h2>Activities and rewards</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Requirements / start window</th><th scope="col">Cost / recovery</th><th scope="col">Reward / limit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Private Time with Glitch</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Romantic (800); after Mutual Authentication; supporter access indicated by the lock</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">120 min; 40 Energy</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">1/day; affection follows the conversation choices</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Talk to Glitch</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Stranger (0)</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">15 min</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">+1 base affection; 5/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Give Chocolate</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Known (25)</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">10 min; 1 Chocolate</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">+4 base affection; 2/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Beyond the Coverage Map</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Friend (100); after Permission to Disconnect / The Camera She Chose; 12:00–15:59; supporter access indicated by the lock</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">120 min; $100; 30 Energy; restores 10 Calm</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">An Unlogged Memory</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Close Friend (200); after The Person Behind the Alert / When the Channel Is Quiet; 18:00–21:59; supporter access indicated by the lock</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">120 min; $150; 35 Energy; 10 Calm</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Networking</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Known (25); Charm 15</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">180 min; $300; 60 Energy; 40 Calm</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">learn Networking once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Automated Systems</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Known (25); Intelligence 25</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">180 min; $300; 60 Energy; 40 Calm</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">learn Automated Systems once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">AI Programming</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Known (25); Technology 28</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">180 min; $300; 60 Energy; 40 Calm</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">learn AI Programming once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Quantum Computing</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Known (25); Technology 30</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">180 min; $300; 60 Energy; 40 Calm</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">learn Quantum Computing once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">A Better Distraction</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Romantic (800); after Mutual Authentication; supporter access indicated by the lock</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">60 min; 40 Energy</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">1/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Intimacy While Pregnant</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">early/final pregnancy stages; all day</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">30 min; 20 Energy</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">1/day</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Talk gives 1 base affection and Chocolate gives 4; use their separate daily allowances. The four technical skills each need Known (25) plus their listed player stat. All four lessons cost 180 minutes, $300, 60 Energy and 40 Calm and can each be learned once; one lesson does not teach the other three.</p><p>Private Time with Glitch takes 120 minutes and 40 Energy, once daily, with the supporter access indicated by the lock. Its affection and intimacy rewards depend on the conversation route and completed ending. This daily allowance is shared by its choices.</p><p>A Better Distraction is the separate animation at Romantic (800) after Mutual Authentication, with the required supporter access: 60 minutes, 40 Energy, once daily, 50 base affection and 60 player Erotic Experience. It has its own daily use, separate from Private Time. During the early/final pregnancy stages, Intimacy While Pregnant is another dedicated option for 30 minutes and 20 Energy, once daily; ordinary private activities pause while she is showing or recovering.</p><p>For her optional family route, enable and unlock pregnancy content, finish Akira’s Pregnancy Protocol, complete Mutual Authentication, and reach 2,000 Glitch affection plus 500 Glitch NPC intimacy experience. Use the family-planning invitation within Private Time and complete the consent conversation. She must not already be pregnant, recovering or have a child from this route; later stages are covered in Pregnancy.</p><p>Glitch also has a separate Kupie Love Training entry. Her ordinary affection, Love Training progress, player Erotic Experience, NPC intimacy experience and Army unit experience do not replace one another.</p><p>Her favorite stats are Intelligence, Technology, Rogue. The learned System Hacking skill improves her relationship bonus.</p><p>Start times are shown; the ending hour is excluded. Base affection receives the relationship bonuses, while direct affection is added as listed. H2Hs and automatic personal scenes complete once; ordinary affection, player Erotic Experience and NPC intimacy experience are separate.</p></section>
<section id="en-troubleshooting"><h2>What usually blocks the next step</h2><ul><li>No first personal scene: complete Story 66 and reach Acknowledged (10), then re-enter the den.</li><li>A H2H is missing: finish its named prior scene and the preceding H2H, not just the relationship stage.</li><li>A date is completed but the route is stuck: the dates are optional; check the automatic scene and H2H prerequisites instead.</li><li>Private Time requires Mutual Authentication and Romantic (800), plus unused daily access.</li><li>A technical lesson is missing after learning it: each skill is taught once; check the four separate stat requirements for the remaining lessons.</li><li>For family readiness, use Glitch’s NPC intimacy experience, not the player’s experience or Kupie training level.</li></ul></section>
<section id="en-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Related_Pages"></span><h2>Related guides</h2><ul><li><a href="game-systems-relationships-dating-and-intimacy.html">Relationships — stages and H2Hs</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-td-army.html">Army — Glitch’s unit</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-pregnancy.html">Pregnancy — family readiness and stages</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-kupie-love-training.html">Kupie Love Training</a></li><li><a href="character-akira.html">Akira — Pregnancy Protocol</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-story-beats.html">Story progress</a></li></ul></section>
</div><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-zh" data-lang-panel="zh" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><section id="zh-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Overview"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-First_Meeting_and_Early_Progress"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Personal_Heart-to-Hearts"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-The_Camera_She_Chose"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-When_the_Channel_Is_Quiet"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-No_Diagnostic_for_This"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Dates"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Kupie's_Love_Training"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Kupie.27s_Love_Training"></span><h2>概览</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="查看完整截图：Glitch 的角色头像。" href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/glitch.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Glitch 的角色头像。" decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/glitch.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Glitch 的角色头像。</figcaption></figure><p>Glitch是藏身处里的黑客。当前路线包含七场个人事件、三次谈心、两场约会、四种技能课程、军队招募后续私人活动及可选生育路线。技术学习与个人故事分别推进。</p></section>
<section id="zh-location"><h2>去哪里找</h2><p>完成主线21后，到未来时代边缘区的未注册住宅区（地图短名“未登记住房”），选择“拜访Glitch的藏身处”，进入不额外耗时。Glitch的头像全天可见，自动个人事件也在同一藏身处触发，约会和谈心从头像开始。</p></section>
<section id="zh-route"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Personal_Quest_Walkthrough"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Current_Route_Boundaries_and_Troubleshooting"></span><h2>路线与关系进展</h2><p>完成主线66、达到已遇见（10）后，进入藏身处触发“已经连接”。随后按自动事件顺序，穿插下方三次谈心。两场约会是可选出游，不是军队招募或个人事件链的必需步骤。</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">自动事件</th><th scope="col">地点／开始时段</th><th scope="col">条件</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">已经连接</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">Glitch的藏身处; 全天</td><td data-label="条件">已遇见（10）；完成：主线66</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">一人红队</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">Glitch的藏身处; 全天</td><td data-label="条件">已知（25）；完成：已经连接</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">永不下课的教室</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">Glitch的藏身处; 全天</td><td data-label="条件">相识（50）；完成：一人红队</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">追踪是双向的</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">Glitch的藏身处; 全天</td><td data-label="条件">相识（50）；完成：永不下课的教室</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">断开的权利</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">Glitch的藏身处; 全天</td><td data-label="条件">朋友（100）；完成：追踪是双向的、她选择的镜头</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">警报背后的人</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">Glitch的藏身处; 全天</td><td data-label="条件">亲密朋友（200）；完成：断开的权利、当频道安静下来</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">双向认证</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">Glitch的藏身处; 全天</td><td data-label="条件">迷恋（400）；完成：警报背后的人、诊断不出的心意</td></tr></tbody></table><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">行动</th><th scope="col">条件／开始时段</th><th scope="col">消耗／恢复</th><th scope="col">奖励／次数</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">她选择的镜头</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">朋友（100）；完成：追踪是双向的；10:00–21:59</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">60分钟；15精力</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">仅一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">当频道安静下来</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">亲密朋友（200）；完成：断开的权利、她选择的镜头；18:00–22:59</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">60分钟；15精力；恢复10镇定</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">仅一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">诊断不出的心意</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">迷恋（400）；完成：警报背后的人、当频道安静下来；20:00–22:59</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">60分钟；15精力</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">仅一次</td></tr></tbody></table><p>“断开的权利”是军队招募节点，个人故事之后仍会继续到“警报背后的人”和“双向认证”。浪漫感（800）并完成“双向认证”后，才有独立的私人相处，不能靠它跳过前面的事件。</p></section>
<section id="zh-activities"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Skill_Lessons"></span><h2>行动与奖励</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">行动</th><th scope="col">条件／开始时段</th><th scope="col">消耗／恢复</th><th scope="col">奖励／次数</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">与Glitch的私密时光</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">浪漫感（800）；完成：双向认证；满足锁形提示所示的支持者内容权限</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">120分钟；40精力</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">每天1次；好感按对话选择结算</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">和 Glitch 交谈</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">陌生人（0）</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">15分钟</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">基础好感+1；每天5次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">送巧克力</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">已知（25）</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">10分钟；巧克力×1</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">基础好感+4；每天2次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">覆盖图之外</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">朋友（100）；完成：断开的权利、她选择的镜头；12:00–15:59；满足锁形提示所示的支持者内容权限</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">120分钟；$100；30精力；恢复10镇定</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">仅一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">未存档的回忆</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">亲密朋友（200）；完成：警报背后的人、当频道安静下来；18:00–21:59；满足锁形提示所示的支持者内容权限</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">120分钟；$150；35精力；10镇定</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">仅一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">人脉经营</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">已知（25）；魅力15</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">180分钟；$300；60精力；40镇定</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">学习人脉经营，仅一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">自动化系统</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">已知（25）；智力25</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">180分钟；$300；60精力；40镇定</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">学习自动化系统，仅一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">AI编程</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">已知（25）；科技28</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">180分钟；$300；60精力；40镇定</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">学习AI编程，仅一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">量子计算</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">已知（25）；科技30</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">180分钟；$300；60精力；40镇定</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">学习量子计算，仅一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">更好的消遣</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">浪漫感（800）；完成：双向认证；满足锁形提示所示的支持者内容权限</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">60分钟；40精力</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">每天1次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">孕期亲密时光</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">怀孕前期／末期；全天</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">30分钟；20精力</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">每天1次</td></tr></tbody></table><p>交谈给1基础好感，巧克力给4，两项各有自己的每日次数。四种技术技能都需要已知（25），并满足各自玩家属性。每堂课均消耗180分钟、$300、60精力和40镇定，每种只学一次；学一堂不会同时学会另外三种。</p><p>“与Glitch的私密时光”每天一次，消耗120分钟、40精力，并需要锁形提示所示的支持者内容权限。好感和亲密奖励看所选分支及是否完成结尾，所有选择共用当天次数。</p><p>“更好的消遣”是独立动画，需要浪漫感（800）、“双向认证”及支持者内容权限；每天一次，消耗60分钟、40精力，获得50基础好感及60玩家情趣经验，和私人相处分别计次。怀孕前期／末期另有“孕期亲密时光”，每天一次，消耗30分钟、20精力；显怀或产后恢复期间，普通私人活动会暂停。</p><p>可选的生育路线需要解锁并开启生育内容、完成Akira的“妊娠规程”及“双向认证”，达到Glitch好感2000和NPC亲密经验500。然后在私人相处中选择共同要孩子的邀请，完成双方同意的对话。她不能已怀孕、处于产后恢复期，或已有这条路线的孩子；后续阶段见生育指南。</p><p>「Kupie 的爱之训练」中也有Glitch的独立进度。普通好感、爱之训练进度、玩家情趣经验、NPC亲密经验及军队单位经验分别计算，不能互相替代。</p><p>她偏好的属性为智力、科技、盗贼。学会系统黑客可提高关系加成。</p><p>表中均为开始时间，不包含结束整点。基础好感受关系加成影响，直接好感按所列数值增加。谈心与个人自动事件只完成一次；普通好感、玩家情趣经验和NPC亲密经验分别计算。</p></section>
<section id="zh-troubleshooting"><h2>卡住时检查什么</h2><ul><li>第一场个人事件没出现：完成主线66并达到已遇见（10），再进入藏身处。</li><li>缺少谈心：除了好感阶段，还要完成表列个人事件和前一次谈心。</li><li>约会完成了但故事没动：两场约会都是可选，检查自动事件与谈心的前置。</li><li>私人相处需要“双向认证”、浪漫感（800），并且当天尚未使用。</li><li>学会后课程消失：每种技能只教一次；剩余课程要分别检查四项属性门槛。</li><li>生育准备看Glitch的NPC亲密经验，不看玩家经验或Kupie训练等级。</li></ul></section>
